======
RULES
======





[ > Ball | no Object no HoleLike] -> [ | > Ball]
+ [ > Ball | HoleLike | Crate ] -> [ | Hole | ]
+ [ > Ball | HoleLike | PlayerLike ] -> [ | Hole | Player]
+ [ > Ball | HoleLike | PortalLike ] -> [ | HoleLike | PortalLike > BallGhost]
+ [ > Ball | HoleLike | Object ] -> [ | Hole | > Object]
+ [ > Ball | HoleLike | HoleLike ] -> [ | HoleLike | Hole ]
+ [ > Ball | HoleLike | ] -> [ | HoleLike | > Ball]


+ [ > Player | PortalLike ] -> [ | PortalLike > PlayerGhost]
+ [ > Crate | PortalLike ] -> [ | PortalLike > CrateGhost]
+ [ > StoneCrate | PortalLike ] -> [ | PortalLike > StoneCrateGhost]
+ [ > Ball | PortalLike ] -> [ | PortalLike > BallGhost]

+ down [> Ghost Ledge | ... | no Wall] -> [Ledge |...| > Ghost]

+ [> Ghost PinkPortal] [PinkTarget] -> [PinkPortal] [> Ghost PinkTarget]
+ [> Ghost BluePortal] [BlueTarget] -> [BluePortal] [> Ghost BlueTarget]
+ [> Ghost RedPortal] [RedTarget] -> [RedPortal] [> Ghost RedTarget]
+ [> Ghost GreenPortal] [GreenTarget] -> [GreenPortal] [> Ghost GreenTarget]


+ [Hardness3 Hardness2Ghost] -> [Hardness3]
+ [Hardness2 Hardness1Ghost] -> [Hardness2]

+ [PlayerGhost] -> [Player]
+ [> CrateGhost] -> [> Crate]
+ [> StoneCrateGhost] -> [> StoneCrate]
+ [> BallGhost] -> [> Ball]




+ [ > Ball | Crate] -> [Ball | ]
+ [ >  HeavyObject | PlayerLike ] -> [ HeavyObject | PlayerLike ]
+ [ >  HeavyObject | Object ] -> [  HeavyObject | > Object  ]






[> Player CoveredHole] -> [> Player Hole]

[> Object no PlayerLike | Pedestal] -> [Object | Pedestal]

[> RedGate] [RedBarrier] -> [> RedGate] []
[> BlueGate] [BlueBarrier] -> [> BlueGate] []
[> YellowGate] [YellowBarrier] -> [> YellowGate] []

[> Gate] -> [InactiveGate]

[> StaticObject] -> [StaticObject]

late [Object WaterLike] -> [DarkWater]

late [Crate HoleLike] -> [FilledHole]
late [Object no PlayerLike HoleLike] -> [Hole]
late [PlayerLike Hole] -> [Hole]

late [Player Spikes] -> [Spikes]

late [PressurePlateUp Object] [Mutex] -> [PressurePlateDown Object Temp] []
+ late [PressurePlateDown no Object] [Mutex] -> [PressurePlateUp Temp] []
+ late [PressurePlate Temp] [GreenBarrier] -> [PressurePlate Temp] [GreenBarrier Temp]
+ late [GreenBarrierUp Temp] -> [GreenBarrierDown]
+ late [GreenBarrierDown Temp] -> [GreenBarrierUp]
+ late [PressurePlate Temp] [] -> [PressurePlate] [Mutex]

==============
WINCONDITIONS
==============

some Player on Exit

